cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: croma
abstract: >-
  Robustness metrics for pathology foundation models. Implements the Robustness Index
  (RI), the Margin-aware Robustness Index (MaRI), the Cross-confounder Robustness Margin
  (CRoMa), and lower-tail statistics that expose brittle subgroups which pooled scores
  hide.
type: software
authors:
